{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Moving Forward with Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galileo said<br><i>&quot;And yet it moves.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I thought<br><i>&quot;Perhaps the same applies to cats?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Moving Forward with Cat&quot; is a physics-based platformer about gravity and pendulum mechanics. Understand the laws of physics and aim for new heights together with a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unique pendulum mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Gravity-defying gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Carefully crafted stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Minimalist art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Moving Forward with Cat,&quot; you cannot fully control the cat. Instead, you need to think ahead and plan the timing of jumps, swings, and launches to overcome each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you play, you'll develop an intuitive understanding of the game's physics and begin to feel the growth of your own playing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover stages that change as the game progresses, new mechanisms, and increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without direct control, prediction and adaptation are necessary. Each level requires thoughtful planning and execution while utilizing momentum, inertia, and gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While playing the game, you'll realize<br><i>&quot;Wait... am I getting better at this game?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the joy of growth that you discover yourself, not joy given by someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If everything goes smoothly, you can complete the main story in about 3 hours.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672320?t=1748056770","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672320?t=1748056770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672320/97ff3783260f6df4161c6bccd586efad213c1654/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748056770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672320/97ff3783260f6df4161c6bccd586efad213c1654/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748056770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Moving Forward with Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galileo said<br><i>&quot;And yet it moves.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I thought<br><i>&quot;Perhaps the same applies to cats?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Moving Forward with Cat&quot; is a physics-based platformer about gravity and pendulum mechanics. Understand the laws of physics and aim for new heights together with a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unique pendulum mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Gravity-defying gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Carefully crafted stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Minimalist art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Moving Forward with Cat,&quot; you cannot fully control the cat. Instead, you need to think ahead and plan the timing of jumps, swings, and launches to overcome each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you play, you'll develop an intuitive understanding of the game's physics and begin to feel the growth of your own playing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover stages that change as the game progresses, new mechanisms, and increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without direct control, prediction and adaptation are necessary. Each level requires thoughtful planning and execution while utilizing momentum, inertia, and gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While playing the game, you'll realize<br><i>&quot;Wait... am I getting better at this game?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the joy of growth that you discover yourself, not joy given by someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If everything goes smoothly, you can complete the main story in about 3 hours.</p>","developers":["Daruma The Factory, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672320/ed72443841e8e3ec7bfdbce366e8b9b0ff1d7222/header.jpg?t=1748056770","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134133,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134133/movie480.mp4?t=1747072211","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134133/movie_max.mp4?t=1747072211"},"name":"trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134133/c703b0a6afa345e00748ecaf66fa6e66e3847d16/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747072211","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134133/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747072211","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134133/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747072211"}}],"name":"Moving Forward with Cat","package